{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Ken] Now, I'm gonna turn on 2000 volts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2320,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] What?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3153,
    "dDurationMs": 1597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the first step"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4750,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in creating snowflakes in the lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6980,
    "dDurationMs": 1631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is totally wild."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8611,
    "dDurationMs": 1289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What?\n- Crazy, huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9900,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tips of those needles are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11340,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a hundred nanometers in diameter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13530,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That is so wild."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Ken Libbrecht is the snowflake guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19000,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I was the snowflake consultant\nfor the movie, \"Frozen.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21930,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's okay to conjure snowflakes\nout of your fingertips,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25550,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they have to be real snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27420,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or people aren't buying it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28854,
    "dDurationMs": 1516,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Ken and Derek laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30370,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The US Post Office made snowflake\nstamps using my pictures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34470,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not the kind of thing\nyou normally think of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36390,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you start doing physics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37960,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you'd be on a postage stamp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39670,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] You've written the\nbook on snowflakes, literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42360,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I had like two\nsuccessful books in a row,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45040,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we just kept making books,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47070,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until finally (laughing)\nthey sold zero copies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50260,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52319,
    "dDurationMs": 2551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54870,
    "dDurationMs": 2363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, are you kind of\nlike a snowflake artist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59956,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I call it a designer snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66600,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because yes, I am\ndesigning this on the fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69040,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have a computer\nthat does all this for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71490,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just do it by hand, so every\none's a little different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86870,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Ken knows so\nmuch about snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89090,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he can design and construct\nthem to his own specifications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93370,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Ken] So what's happening\nnow is it's growing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95270,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and doing its thing at some..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97560,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's at -13 Celsius now, but\nI want to make some branches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101660,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll just turn this down to -15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103760,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I'm gonna increase\nthe humidity a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106130,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the super saturation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107610,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll start to see\nbranches come out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110390,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] See you\nchanging those conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112700,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just caused the plate to kind\nof stop and become really--"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116270,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I changed the growth\nconditions to prefer branches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120210,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This little thing right\nthere, that little nub,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122430,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's the only thing that\ntouches the sapphire substrate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125840,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rest of this is all growing above."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128200,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This increases the air flow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130680,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are droplets forming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132020,
    "dDurationMs": 2001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now I'm really kicking it into gear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134021,
    "dDurationMs": 2589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mystical orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136610,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what I'm gonna do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137443,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is I'm gonna turn that\nhumidity down to zero,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139620,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the droplets are starting to recede,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142770,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this will stop growing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144380,
    "dDurationMs": 3348,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and kind of start to facet a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147728,
    "dDurationMs": 1422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say I want branches again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149150,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now I'm gonna really hammer on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151830,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So you're giving\nit a lot of moisture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153180,
    "dDurationMs": 3043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A lot of moisture now, but\nyou'll see side branches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159980,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really start to feel you\nunderstand what's going on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162230,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you can say, \"Now I'm gonna do this,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164540,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166150,
    "dDurationMs": 2122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fun. I can predict the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168272,
    "dDurationMs": 1448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169720,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like to think they're\nbetter than nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173040,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the reason is that\nthe facets of just sharp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176720,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the edges on these things\nare just sharp and crisp,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179440,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whereas in the sky they have to fall,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182380,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by the time they fall,\nand you pick them up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185300,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you put them under a microscope,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186760,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they've started to evaporate a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188350,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boy, these are just,\n(snaps) bang, just crisp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192110,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] The first close-up\nphotograph of a snowflake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194360,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the wild was taken in 1885"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197530,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by American meteorologist,\nWilson A. Bentley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201340,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was Bentley who originated the idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203700,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that no two snowflakes are\nalike, and he would know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208090,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the course of his life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209370,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he took more than 5,000\nphotos of snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212760,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a selection of which appear\nin his book, \"Snow Crystals,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215950,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is still in print today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219400,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But most snowflakes don't look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221170,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the ones Bentley photographed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223100,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because he selected only\nthose in pristine condition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227090,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with uncommon beauty and symmetry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230150,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I mean, when you're\nlooking for snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231800,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll take a big piece of cardboard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233468,
    "dDurationMs": 1292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you just glance at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234760,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(exhaling)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236390,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crap, nothing, brush them aside, more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240400,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, each brush is a thousand snowflakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243700,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're hard to find."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245170,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're one in a million,\nI mean, literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247370,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] We are all so used\nto seeing pictures like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250190,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we are blind to the\nmysteries of the snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253990,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, why do they all have\nsix fold, radial symmetry?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258110,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why are they so intricate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260180,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet so different from each other?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262650,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do opposite arms of a snowflake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mirror each other so perfectly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267440,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, how does one side\nof the snowflake know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270130,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what the other side is doing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272630,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And why are snowflakes flat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275320,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're usually millimeters in diameter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277570,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but micro meters thick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279380,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The edges of a plate can be\nas narrow as razorblades,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283730,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the mystery goes even deeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286390,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone pictures snowflakes like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289010,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the truth is they take\nall sorts of different forms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292420,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this, a hollow column."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294740,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a snowflake?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295573,
    "dDurationMs": 1977,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Libbrecht] That is a snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297550,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] There are also\nneedles, cups and bullets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302420,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is like my favorite\nkind of snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304500,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a capped column."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305730,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It started out growing as a column,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307950,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then the temperature changed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309440,
    "dDurationMs": 2607,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you've got plates\ngrowing on either end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312047,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318350,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just a cacophony of different shapes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320640,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of these appear spontaneously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322610,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no DNA or any kind of a blueprint"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325360,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for what's going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326193,
    "dDurationMs": 2357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just water vapor freezing into ice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328550,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all this happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329530,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So you've identified"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331130,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "35 different types of snowflakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334250,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, there's no really one way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336770,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to define a type of snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339570,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first chart of snowflakes\nis like 41, I think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342760,
    "dDurationMs": 2727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it got bigger - 60 or 70,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345487,
    "dDurationMs": 3313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the latest one by\nsome Japanese physicists,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348800,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think had 108 different\ntypes of snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352460,
    "dDurationMs": 2499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I found 108 was too many."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354959,
    "dDurationMs": 1545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Ken laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356504,
    "dDurationMs": 996,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(snow blowing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357500,
    "dDurationMs": 3941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] How does simple ice\ncreate so many distinct forms?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361441,
    "dDurationMs": 3069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(curious orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364510,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All snowflakes form in much the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367670,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water evaporates into water vapor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370030,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "individual molecules bouncing\naround in the atmosphere,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373040,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as this vapor rises,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374660,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it cools and becomes super saturated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377690,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning there are more\nwater molecules in the air"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380110,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than there would be in\nequilibrium at this temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383640,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water molecules condense\nonto dust particles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386240,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to form tiny droplets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388260,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And although the temperature\nmay be below freezing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390850,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the droplets don't immediately freeze,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393830,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at some point, one\ndroplet will freeze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397900,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside, the water\nmolecules lock into place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401380,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forming a hexagonal crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404460,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This structure results\nfrom the peculiarities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407270,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of water molecules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408589,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oxygen atoms attract\nelectrons more than hydrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411959,
    "dDurationMs": 2511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since the molecule has a bent shape,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414470,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's polar with oxygen\nbeing slightly negative,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417600,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the hydrogens, slightly positive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420220,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since unlike charges attract,\nhydrogen from one molecule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424030,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will sit next to an oxygen\nfrom another molecule,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427000,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forming a so-called hydrogen bond,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429770,
    "dDurationMs": 3563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is what creates the\nhexagonal molecular lattice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434400,
    "dDurationMs": 2103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how does this microscopic lattice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436503,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grow into a hexagonal\ncrystal that we can see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441270,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So you start with a chunk of ice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443460,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and these little guys are\nmeant to be water molecules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446630,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what happens is there\nare these flat surfaces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449370,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which are the facet surfaces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450760,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at a molecular scale,\nthey're very smooth and flat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454560,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so when a molecule hits,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456680,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a water vapor molecule hits\nthat smooth and flat surface,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459730,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it tends to bounce off,\nwhereas here, it's rough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463070,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a lot of dangling\nmolecular bonds over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465770,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a rough surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466710,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so when these molecules\nhit, they tend to stick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470020,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a statistical thing, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471960,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the probabilities are\nhigh that they stick here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474380,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and low that they stick here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476140,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you take any shape,\nand you just let it grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478770,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a little while, the\nrough areas fill in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482090,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the flat areas don't grow very fast,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484550,
    "dDurationMs": 1873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you end up with a faceted shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487580,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And that's how we\nget from the quantum mechanics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490090,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that governs a water molecule,\nto a hexagonal prism of ice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495244,
    "dDurationMs": 4836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This prism has two basal\nfacets and six prism facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500080,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501730,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the basal facets grow\nfast, you get a column."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504960,
    "dDurationMs": 3973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the prism facets grow faster,\nyou get a flat snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510060,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once there is a seed crystal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511930,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nearby water droplets evaporate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514430,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and deposit water molecules\nonto the growing snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518770,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since the corners of the\nhexagonal prism stick out farther"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522270,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into humid air, they grow faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525310,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now they extend even farther,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528310,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they grow even faster in\na positive feedback loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532270,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This gives rise to six radial branches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535990,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the corners of these branches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538310,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "additional branches can\nform for the same reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541600,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around a hundred thousand droplets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544120,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are required to make a single snowflake,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547050,
    "dDurationMs": 3403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the process usually\ntakes 30 to 45 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551930,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 1930s, Ukichiro Nakaya"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554170,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was systematically studying snowflakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556270,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the University of Hokkaido in Japan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558913,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He discovered that the\ndifferent types of snowflakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561791,
    "dDurationMs": 3729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't all occur under the same conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565520,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, two factors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567320,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the temperature and\nlevel of super saturation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570380,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "determine what type of snowflake grows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573400,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His findings are summarized\nin the Nakaya Diagram,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577460,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not a simple pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580070,
    "dDurationMs": 3321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around -2 Celsius, you get plates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583391,
    "dDurationMs": 3869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At -5 Celsius, columns and needles form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587260,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At -15 Celsius, it's plates again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590440,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then below -20, you\nget columns and plates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594690,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Nakaya Diagram allows us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596690,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to understand a rough\nhistory of any snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600360,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does each snowflake in\nessence reveal its history"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606520,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through its shape?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607904,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, absolutely, to some degree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610270,
    "dDurationMs": 1847,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can definitely look\nat a snowflake and say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612117,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Yeah, I know what conditions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613947,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"that crystal grew under, more or less.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616560,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your typical weather\npatterns, fronts, cold front,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619390,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that produces a lot of capped columns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620870,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because as the cloud moves\nup, it starts to get colder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623350,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and initially start to\nfreeze at around -6, -10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628490,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes columns, and as it gets colder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630820,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it makes branches and plates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633160,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so you get capped columns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635610,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] This also explains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636890,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why snowflakes are so intricate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639120,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The temperature and humidity\nat each moment of growth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642310,
    "dDurationMs": 3046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "determines the structures\nformed in that moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645356,
    "dDurationMs": 3224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The symmetry you see\nis not because one side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648580,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somehow knows what the\nother side is doing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651280,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because both sides of\na single snowflake grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653970,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the exact same conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When the crystal changes its position,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659300,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the temperature will change, say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660830,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all six branches will see\nthe same temperature change,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664480,
    "dDurationMs": 2123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they'll all respond the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668180,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Different\nsnowflakes, on the other hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670380,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each take a unique path,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672370,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore they experience\na unique set of conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675650,
    "dDurationMs": 2873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why no two snowflakes are alike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679890,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the lab, you can\ncarefully control the conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683330,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so theoretically it should be possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685410,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create almost identical\nsnowflakes, and indeed, Ken has."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690920,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's in here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692159,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Poke your flashlight\nin there, and you'll see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694600,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Ah ha, I'm imagining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696420,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these are seed crystals of a sort?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697960,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Ken] Those are a little\nsparkly snow crystals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700400,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701233,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You know this is another little chamber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702610,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just a cold plate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703970,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a little\nsapphire disc in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707000,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I'm going to push\nthis thing, my sapphire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709320,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the way in here, and the\ncrystals will waft onto to it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712570,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and hopefully stay there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715260,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea popped in, it's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716490,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, if I grow two next to one another,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718090,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they'll be kind of identical,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719860,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I call them identical twin snowflakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722470,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause they're like identical twin people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724560,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not exactly the same,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726040,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but clearly more alike\nthan you would ever expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729140,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(gentle orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737400,
    "dDurationMs": 2278,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it really true that no\ntwo snowflakes are alike?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739678,
    "dDurationMs": 1568,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, that's just a silly question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741246,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Ken laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742480,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's silly because no two trees are like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745900,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no two grains of sand are like,\nno two anything are alike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749390,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anything that has any complexity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751510,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is different from everything else,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753170,
    "dDurationMs": 3317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because once you introduce complexity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756487,
    "dDurationMs": 3763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then there's just an uncountable\nnumber of ways to make it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760250,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] If a pair of twins snowflakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761900,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are growing too close together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763870,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they end up competing for\nmoisture between them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766890,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stunting both of their growths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770290,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Nakaya Diagram allows\nus to understand a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773410,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about snowflake formation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775240,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ken has used his experiments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776750,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build his own version of the chart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779164,
    "dDurationMs": 1676,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what it doesn't explain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780840,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is why do ice crystals form\nthis way in the first place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784290,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, why do we get\nplates and then columns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787450,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then plates and columns again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790420,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has been a mystery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791920,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "essentially since Nakaya\nintroduced his diagram"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794300,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back in the 1930s, but Ken\nbelieves he now has an answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799140,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anytime you have a crystal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800820,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reason why you get\nthese smooth flat facets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804420,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is because it's not easy to\ngrow more crystal on top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808090,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so-called nucleation barriers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810880,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you need is a critical\ndensity of additional molecules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813800,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the substance before\nthey can come together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816110,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to form a little island that\nis stable enough to grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819640,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and add another layer onto the crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822407,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're first forming a snowflake,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824420,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're always gonna start\nwith a hexagonal prism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826980,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with its two basal facets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828810,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and six prism facets around the side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831313,
    "dDurationMs": 2657,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the nucleation barrier\nfor the basal facets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833970,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is different than that\nof the prism facets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836980,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the nucleation barrier is\nlower for the prism facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839770,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then they grow faster, and\nyou get plate like structures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843220,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the nucleation barrier is\nlower for the basal facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845820,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then they grow faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847000,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you end up with\ncolumn-like structures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849610,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the nucleation barriers of ice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851690,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are known as a function of temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854240,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this explains why around -2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857430,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the prism facets grow\nfaster, and you get plates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860160,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because their nucleation barrier is lower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863240,
    "dDurationMs": 2825,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also see why below -20 or so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866065,
    "dDurationMs": 1725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well then you get columns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867790,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the basal facet\nnucleation barrier is lower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870730,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at those temperatures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872330,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what doesn't make sense\nis why we should get columns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875370,
    "dDurationMs": 4303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at around -5 Celsius and\nthen plates again at -15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880508,
    "dDurationMs": 2052,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is happening?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882560,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well Ken's hypothesis is that\nthese nucleation barriers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885580,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are valid only for large flat facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888440,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you had really narrow facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890640,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, the nucleation\nbarriers would be different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893050,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Ken proposes that narrow basal facets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895810,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a dip in their nucleation\nbarrier around -4 Celsius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899690,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and narrow prism facets have a dip at -15,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903150,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so his hypothesis is that the\ngraph should look like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906990,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This then is consistent\nwith all the different forms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909640,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of snowflakes that grow\nat different temperatures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912380,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what accounts for these dips?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914990,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, let's say we have\na narrow prism facet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917700,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're growing a plate snowflake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920340,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water molecules that hit the basal facets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922960,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are unlikely to reach the\ncritical density required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925280,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to overcome the nucleation barrier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927360,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that surface grows only slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930140,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on either side of\nthis narrow prism facet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933270,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "water molecules can\nstick on the rough edges,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936400,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to minimize surface energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938150,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ideal shape of this\nface would be semicircular."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941980,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if only the top few layers\nof water molecules are mobile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945590,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try to lower the surface energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947480,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many of them diffuse onto the prism facet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950450,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in the process,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951430,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they exceed the critical density required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953360,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to overcome the nucleation barrier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955370,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they can grow the\ncrystal on the prism facet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958890,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So due to this narrow edge,\nthe nucleation barrier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961600,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is effectively lower than it would be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963770,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a large prism facet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966350,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A similar effect happens\nfor the basal facets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968700,
    "dDurationMs": 2027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just at a different temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970727,
    "dDurationMs": 2383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Ken has done\nexperiments to investigate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973110,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether these effects\nare observed in the lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976200,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so I did a series of\nexperiments using that apparatus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979280,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and man, it's just like,\nboom, just like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981979,
    "dDurationMs": 1624,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughing) Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984680,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you make a model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986830,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you sort of find it's\nsupposed to do something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989340,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it sorta does, it's just\nlike, this might be right!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993880,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So far, the results agree\nnicely with the hypothesis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997380,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So after 85 years, maybe we now understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000780,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the molecular physics of ice well enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002820,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to finally explain why snowflakes grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005540,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into such a diverse collection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007280,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of columnar and plate-like forms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010650,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And I've done a lot of my career"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012300,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in astronomy and astrophysics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody ever asks you what\nit's good for, I mean, never."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017770,
    "dDurationMs": 1573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not even once did anyone say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019343,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"What are those black holes\ngonna be used for?\" No,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022704,
    "dDurationMs": 1296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Ken and Derek laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024000,
    "dDurationMs": 2847,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Saturn's rings, \"Why do you\ncare about Saturn's rings?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026847,
    "dDurationMs": 2263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"What's the motivation\nfor studying Saturn,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029110,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nobody asks that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030350,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every time I give a talk, people are like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032017,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"What are you doing? What\non earth is this for?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035110,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll tell you the real reason,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037090,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the real reason that I got into this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039330,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You look at a snowflake\nand you kind of go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041097,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Um, actually, (laughs)\nwe don't have any idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044577,
    "dDurationMs": 983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"how that works.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045560,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that doesn't work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047900,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have to know how that works, dammit!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049860,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I want to be the guy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050700,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that figures out how snowflakes work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053070,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's always been a driver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054410,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, as a scientist, you\nwant to figure something out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058660,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright electronic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064470,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hey, this video was\nsponsored by Brilliant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066670,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the interactive learning platform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068230,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that lets you tackle\nconcepts in math, science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070640,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and computer science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072030,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, YouTube videos\nare great for finding out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074250,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about new areas of interest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076030,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you really want to master a topic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077870,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to try problems for yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080440,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what Brilliant\nallows you to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082780,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They've recently revamped\na lot of their courses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085060,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make them even more interactive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086910,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like their course on logic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088840,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's a puzzle where\nyou have to sort robots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091730,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The questions increase\nin difficulty as you go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094790,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they've always got helpful hints,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096370,
